{"pin":"BH00483","subcodes":[{"code":"BH00483","anchor":"","first_line":"Praise be unto Him Who, after His sanctification beyond all tongues, hath spoken, and Who, after His transcendence above all utterance, hath taught. He, verily, is the One Who [3.5s]... ...It hath been decreed that, if anyone should have a troubled dream and should thereby be grieved and saddened, he may recite this blessed verse… O Thou by Whose name the sea of joy moveth and the fragrance of happiness is wafted!","first_line_orig":"الحمد لمن نطق بعد تقدیسه عن اللسان و علم بعد تنزیهه عن البیان انه لهو الذی  ","language":"mixed","word_count":"1500","notes":" \u003ca href=\"http://web.archive.org/web/20070930181707/http://bahai-library.com/resources/leiden.list/leiden.list.html#189\"\u003eLL#189\u003c/a\u003e","translations":[],"refs":[{"kind":"manuscript","code":"BLIB_Or15717.233","source":"BLIB_Or15717","locator":"233"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA07:128","source":"INBA07","locator":"128","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v007/?page=66"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA18:421","source":"INBA18","locator":"421","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v018/?page=211"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"Majlis210461.126x","source":"Majlis210461","locator":"126x","url":"http://bluefin.live/wp-content/uploads/2024/09/majlis_210461.pdf"},{"kind":"music","code":"C. Wolcott","source":"C","locator":"Wolcott","url":"https://youtu.be/b-IL_kAQ6Rc"},{"kind":"music","code":"Sixth Choral Music Festival Concert","source":"Sixth Choral Music Festival Concert","url":"https://youtu.be/rC2stCTVZ9o"},{"kind":"publication","code":"ADM2#113 p.202x","source":"ADM2","locator":"113 p.202x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/558.pdf#page=202"},{"kind":"publication","code":"ASAT1.072x","source":"ASAT1","locator":"072x","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/427.pdf#page=42"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MAS4.366bx","source":"MAS4","locator":"366bx","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/b/MAS4/mas4-366.htm